    "testimonials": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "2fe7250e-17f1-4343-b8e8-54a450ea46dd": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"These have been a lifesaver for me. I recently had a single mastectomy & have had a hard time getting a bra to work with the other inserts I've tried. I wasn't sure what size I needed so I ordered two different sets. I highly recommend these to anyone that needs them.\"</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HC19.jpg",
            "author": "Pamela W"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"It's so nice to find a product that actually works. I used them for a night out under a thin bodysuit and they were perfect. They didn't move around, gave me support and covered all the important areas 😊. The size chart was a huge help.\"</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/HC100_Latte_2.png",
            "author": "Rachele A"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"A miracle for those who need comfy bras but also want some “headlight” coverage. These fit perfectly, are super comfortable, and really stay put. Highly recommend!!\"</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_design_65.png",
            "author": "Angie Budnick"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-1": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"These Cloudz are very comfortable, fit well actually perfectly and don't slip around at all. I am a 36G and a very petite woman. You don't even know you have them in your bra. I only need it in one side and works really well. If you order these you won't be unhappy. I purchased size XL.\"</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Facetune_24-09-2022-14-20-21_1.jpg",
            "author": "Wendy Y"
          }
        },
        "testimonial-0": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5",
            "text": "<p>\"It is hard to find the proper size insert for smaller busts, but the XS was perfect. Excellent quality, love the color options, and fits perfectly in my sportsbras. Worth the cost! (I was looking for something similar to UA sports bra inserts, and these are even better.\"</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_3801.jpg",
            "author": "Jenny I"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "2fe7250e-17f1-4343-b8e8-54a450ea46dd",
        "testimonial-4",
        "testimonial-2",
        "testimonial-1",
        "testimonial-0"
      ],
